        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CMO_0000230"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The magnitude of the T wave, the deflection following the QRS complex representing repolarization of the ventricles as illustrated by and electrocardiograph.</obo:IAO_0000115>
