        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CMO_0000782"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Blood pressure measured in the pulmonary artery during systole, that is, during contraction of the heart ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
