        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CMO_0000077"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A value resulting from the quantification of a morphological or physiological parameter of vascular smooth muscle, the contractile soft tissue having fine myofibrils but lacking transverse striations composing the majority of the wall of blood vessels, the network of muscular tubes that carry blood through the body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
