        <obo:IAO_0000115>This is any measurement of the absolute or relative amount(s) of one or more of the ribonucleic acids (RNAs) found in the pericardial sac, a double-walled sac (serous plus fibrous pericardium) containing the heart and the roots of the great vessels.</obo:IAO_0000115>
