        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>adenocarcinoma NOS (morphologic abnormality)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>adenocarcinoma, malignant</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
