        <obo:NCIT_P366>Hmong</obo:NCIT_P366>
        <obo:NCIT_P98>Early in the 19th century, the Hmong migrated to French Indochina, which comprised Vietnam, Cambodia and Laos.  In 1947, Hmong officially became citizens of Loas.  Later a number of Hmong emigrated to Thailand and the United States.</obo:NCIT_P98>
