        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C43866"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collective term used to identify indigenous peoples of northern Iraq and neighboring areas of Syria and Turkey, who also identify themselves as Aramaeans and Chaldeans. They are the survivors of the formerly extensive Aramaic- or Syriac- speaking Christian community of northern Iraq, southeastern Turkey, and northwestern Iran.</obo:IAO_0000115>
