        <obo:IAO_0000115>an cardiovascular adverse event that is a collection of blood outside the blood vessels, generally the result of hemorrhage, or more specifically, internal bleeding. It is commonly called a bruise.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>YH: MedDRA ID: 10018852 is for &quot;haematoma&quot;; MedDRA ID: 10019428 is for &quot;hematoma&quot;.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>SS, YH</obo:IAO_0000117>
