            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A medicl occurrence that is ordered by, or carried out by, a healthcare provider on a patient with a diagnostic or therapeutic purpose.</obo:IAO_0000115>
