        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OPMI_0000275"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>As part of the OMOP CDM, use the type concept that be reflects the source of the death record. It is possible that an administrative claims database would source death information from a government file so do not assume the Death Type is the same as the Visit Type, etc.</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An electronic health record that records the information of the death record of a person.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Long Tran, Oliver He</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>Death Type Concept</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://ohdsi.github.io/CommonDataModel/cdm54.html#DEATH</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">electronic death record</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


