        <obo:IAO_0000115>Subdivision of trunk that lies between the head and the abdomen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>note that we use the slightly verbose term &apos;thoracic segment of trunk&apos; to avoid confusuon with insect thorax. todo - taxonomic constraints. Also, in FMA &apos;thorax&apos; is a synonym for chest</obo:IAO_0000232>
