        <obo:IAO_0000115>An interconnected tubular multi-tissue structure contains fluid that is actively transported around the organism[ZFA]. Examples: vasculature of lung, vasculature of face.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>see also: vascular system. Consider merging?</obo:IAO_0000116>
