        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl"/>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>(...) the ability of ectoderm to produce neuronal cells is a general metazoan feature.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>neurectodermal</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000013>we prefer neurectoderm to neural ectoderm since placodal ectoderm is not classified here</obo:UBPROP_0000013>
