        <obo:IAO_0000115>Part of the landmass of Eurasia, with the western portion of the latter occupied by Europe, lying east of the Suez Canal, east of the Ural Mountains, and south of the Caucasus Mountains and the Caspian and Black Seas. It is bounded on the east by the Pacific Ocean, on the south by the Indian Ocean, and on the north by the Arctic Ocean.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>GAZ</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>GAZ:00000465</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Asia</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


